{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/LUIv01_logo_all.gif?t=1745407233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A 29-year-old ordinary guy, Ethan Syu works as an on-site computer engineer by day and runs a struggling personal video channel by night. On his way to a filming location, he gets into an accident. When he wakes up the next day, he discovers a mysterious user interface occasionally popping up in his vision, seemingly showing him the affection levels of certain people around him...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this visual novel, players will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore multiple story branches and make choices that shape the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with 3 unique characters, each with their own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase affection levels through dialogue choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the truth behind the mysterious interface and reveal deeper plot elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience rich narrative content and unlock multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice you make affects how the story unfolds. As the affection levels change, Ethan's ordinary life will transform completely\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/web_v02_SJY.png?t=1745407233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/web_v02_YCS.png?t=1745407233\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366940/extras/web_v02_JJS.png?t=1745407233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=